# Release the extension > The trip a version takes
# ipm-overview:docs/use-cases/release-the-extension.md#L11
# 32b3cda0b610d6636b3bbd17b9ddce57b43ec80b

# The whole trip. The push is a person's, the build is CI's, the approval is a
# reviewer's — one journey, several hands.
whole::a Take a version through the release ::e

prep::a Prepare the version ::e
  --> tag::a Push the release tag ::e
  --> build::a Build and draft the release ::e
  --> gate::a Approve the release environment ::e
  --> publish::a Publish to the marketplaces ::e
prep, tag, build, gate, publish --::P--> whole

# Who and what
dev::a Release maintainer ::t --> prep, tag
rev::a Release reviewer ::t --> gate
wf::a release workflow ::t --> build, publish
tagart::a v0.4.1 ::t --> tag, build
vsix::a the nine platform packages ::t --> build, publish
listing::a the marketplace listings ::t --> publish

dev --> Maintainer ::c
rev --> Reviewer ::c
wf --> CI check ::c
tagart --> release tag ::c
vsix --> extension package ::c, output ::c
listing --> marketplace listing ::c
